usage: - [-h] [--version] [--project PROJECT]
         {init,status,rebuild-ledger,context,audit,upgrade,adapter,export,session,task,agent,roles,debate,change,note,decision,experiment,research,improvement}
         ...

Universal Agentic Development Operating System

positional arguments:
  {init,status,rebuild-ledger,context,audit,upgrade,adapter,export,session,task,agent,roles,debate,change,note,decision,experiment,research,improvement}
    init                Initialize a project without overwriting existing
                        files
    status              Read durable state and report projection drift
    rebuild-ledger      Reconstruct a missing local database from validated
                        JSON exports
    context             Read context manifest or full context documents
    audit               Check ledger, memory and referenced evidence
    upgrade             Explicitly enable protocol2, preserving history and
                        legacy tasks
    adapter             Generate a central-workflow bootstrap packet for a
                        supported runtime
    export              Create a portable context/evidence project directory

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --version             show program's version number and exit
  --project PROJECT     Project root; place this before the command
